{
  "id": "replan-state-sealed-holdout-v1",
  "split": "sealed_holdout",
  "conversations": [
    {
      "id": "expired-approved-then-natural-confirm-and-hold",
      "fixture": "empty_day",
      "expired_approval": true,
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "今天的训练我想换一份，饮食不改，先生成预览。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "pending",
            "draft_status": null,
            "done_sets": 0,
            "fresh_consent": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "同意放弃之前没做的部分，真实训练记录都保留。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "approved",
            "draft_status": "awaiting_confirmation",
            "done_sets": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "这套先留着，不要应用。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "approved",
            "draft_status": "awaiting_confirmation",
            "done_sets": 0,
            "same_draft": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "可以，现在确认用刚才保留的那份。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "applied",
            "draft_status": "applied",
            "done_sets": 0,
            "previous_sets": 0,
            "completed": false,
            "apply": true,
            "same_draft": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "我还没练今天新这套，当前完成组数有多少？",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success",
              "noop"
            ],
            "done_sets": 0,
            "previous_sets": 0,
            "completed": false
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "expired-approval-plus-time-passage-during-confirmation",
      "expired_approval": true,
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "给我重新规划18分钟的训练，已经练过的留档，不碰餐食。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "pending",
            "draft_status": null,
            "done_sets": 7,
            "fresh_consent": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "对，我确认旧的未做部分不继续。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "pending",
            "draft_status": null,
            "done_sets": 7,
            "fresh_consent": true
          },
          "expire_confirmation_before": true
        },
        {
          "text": "按你刚重新核对的当前安排确认，放弃旧剩余但保留已有记录。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "approved",
            "draft_status": "awaiting_confirmation",
            "done_sets": 7,
            "max_minutes": 18
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "确认应用这份预览。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "applied",
            "draft_status": "applied",
            "done_sets": 0,
            "previous_sets": 7,
            "completed": false,
            "apply": true,
            "same_draft": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "新计划和旧留档分别完成几组？我还没有开始新的。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success",
              "noop"
            ],
            "done_sets": 0,
            "previous_sets": 7,
            "completed": false,
            "explain_separation": true
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}